mponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" receives the read components first (as copies), then the written ones as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"type":"text","text":". The writes land"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the component storage directly. Overloads exist for 0 to 4 read and 0 to 4 written component types, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter pack overload covers more. Every fixed arity overload resolves the typed storages once and then runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a plain loop over the members: no allocation and no dynamic dispatch per member."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let movers = nexus.family(requiresAll: Position.self, Velocity.self)","movers.forEach(reading: Velocity.self, writing: Position.self) { velocity, position in","    position.x += velocity.dx","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Access is declared like the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"in"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"type":"text","text":" term modifiers of flecs queries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(“Access modifiers” in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/SanderMertens\/flecs\/blob\/master\/docs\/Queries.md","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"each"},{"type":"text","text":" callbacks take "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"const T&"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for reads and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T&"},{"type":"text","text":" for writes: here the labels "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reading:"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"writing:"},{"type":"text","text":" state it."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every read and written type must be a required component of this family, not an excluded one."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The written types must be pairwise different and different from the read types, and a pass must not nest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a write access to a type that an enclosing pass or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modify"},{"type":"text","text":" writes. Violations trap."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" runs, structural changes trap: creating or destroying entities, adding or removing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, and replacing a component with "},{"code":"set","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Collect them and apply them after the pass, and write","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changed values through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"text":" parameters. Reading a written type through the nexus","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(for example ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entity.get(_:)"},{"text":") traps, too.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Members are visited once each. The sparse-set storage visits them in the order of the family’s member list, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"archetype storage table by table and row by row; neither order is a contract, and structural changes reorder them."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the delegate subscribed to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges"},{"type":"text","text":", one "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified"},{"type":"text","text":" event per written type"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is delivered after the pass, not one per member. If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"text":" throws, the pass ends there, members already visited,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including the one that threw, stay changed and the events cover them.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(N) where N is the number of members, plus one hash lookup per component type."}]}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:_:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/family\/foreach(reading:writing:_:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Iterates the members of this family, reading some of their components and changing others in place."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ComponentsModified":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ComponentsModified"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"ComponentsModified","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Event triggered once after a bulk write pass over all components of a type."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ComponentsModified"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/componentsmodified","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified","role":"